    <defName>Rimfolk_Plan_GraveGarden</defName>
    <label>grave-garden</label>
    <description>The Quiet Bell's grave-garden: a walled garden of graves in rows on flagstone paths between flower beds, a lamp at each corner, the bell tower of stone with the bell's frame at its middle, the ossuary of sarcophagi, a fire in the yard, the quiet hostel's beds and table for anyone on the road, and the storehouse of linen and herbs.</description>
