  <ColonyCouncil.TownPlanDef>
    <defName>Rimfolk_Plan_BoutRing</defName>
    <label>bout-ring</label>
    <description>The Circuit of Tamers' ring: the great bout-ring fenced round a floor of packed earth with a gate at either end and a lamp at each corner, the small ring for the young, the hatchery's warm boxes, stables in three pens for every kind of beast, a fire, the tamers' bunkhouse and the storehouse of feed.</description>
